      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**XOM has the highest predicted probability, at 70.09%, followed by WMT at 69.93%.** The top 10 among the 50 most liquid stocks, using the March 5, 2026 market-close anchor, are: [1]\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Predicted probability |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | XOM | 70.09% [1] |\n| 2 | WMT | 69.93% [1] |\n| 3 | MRK | 68.43% [1] |\n| 4 | QCOM | 67.92% [1] |\n| 5 | C | 67.41% [1] |\n| 6 | PFE | 66.71% [1] |\n| 7 | TXN | 66.02% [1] |\n| 8 | PG | 65.84% [1] |\n| 9 | AMZN | 65.14% [1] |\n| 10 | AMD | 64.78% [1] |\n\nThese are Kumo Relational model probabilities, not observed returns or guarantees. **Horizon caveat:** the template targets a positive five-session adjusted-close return, but counts qualifying outcomes within **five calendar days** after the anchor, March 5 at 21:00 UTC. It therefore does not exactly confirm the requested next-five-trading-session forecast. [1]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — positive_return — evidence `hermes-receipt:089a67f9d4ef8e845e812e41bc1ece6b98cc8d933b7b64cb9da9f23a4c691c90`",
